      "message": "If all you want is a variable that can safely be read and written across threads, which seems to be what you\u0027re doing here, a simple \"volatile boolean\" is sufficient. (You can\u0027t do things like capture that in a lambda though, since captured variables must be final.)\n\nFor a good refresher/primer on the java memory model and synchronization, you can look at:\n\nhttps://developer.android.com/training/articles/smp\n\nif you haven\u0027t already.",
